  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Investment Portfolio Management  Building Up Institutionscomma Systems and Human Capital</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this institutional development initiative is to strengthen the capacity of the Argentine authorities to manage its develoment portfolio financed  by IFIs  by  (i) introducing institutional reforms in key areas that constitute bottlenecks for efficient project implementation;  (ii) build up MIS tools to enable the proper monitoring of project activities at the project level and as part of the authorities portfolio monitoring responsibilities; and (iii) introducing improved human resource management policies for project staff  and sustained efforts to qualify staff involved in project management activities.  To contribute to the achievement of the development goals of the government by strengthening its capacity to efficiently and effectively manage the portfolio of investment development projects financed by IFIs through: (i) improvement of the designcomma preparation and approval of projects at the national and provincial levels; (ii) improvement of procurement capacity of agencies implementing investment projects; (iii) improvement of portfolio monitoring.</narrative>
  </description>
